<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Santander 96 attributable seen up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Santander 96 attributable seen up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank Banco Santander. Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    391.22     341.74    386.17 - 397.20</p>
<p>    Operating income	 192.34     158.71    179.71 - 209.98</p>
<p>    Net attributable	  85.85	75.39     85.33 - 86.40</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)		537	  472	  534-541</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>Banco Santander is expected to release its results on January 20, 21 or 22.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
